<button wx:if="{{!embedded}}" class="entry" bindtap="toggle">任务 <text class="entry-count">{{tasks.length}}</text><text class="entry-next">›</text></button>
<view wx:if="{{embedded && tasks.length}}"><view class="note">本段对话任务 · 点击查看状态或结果</view><view wx:if="{{reconnecting}}" class="connection">暂时无法获取状态，正在重新连接。原任务已保留。</view><view wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select"><view class="row"><text class="name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="badge {{item.status}}">{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="meta">任务 {{item.id}}</view><view class="detail">{{item.phase||item.error}}</view><view class="footer">{{item.status==='done'?'查看结果 ↗':'查看状态 ›'}}</view></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{open}}" class="scrim" bindtap="toggle"></view>
<view wx:if="{{open}}" class="panel"><view class="heading"><view>我的任务</view><button class="close" bindtap="toggle">×</button></view><view class="note">当前对话 · 最近 15 个任务</view><view wx:if="{{reconnecting}}" class="connection">暂时无法获取状态，正在重新连接。原任务已保留。</view><scroll-view scroll-y class="list"><view wx:if="{{!tasks.length}}" class="empty">还没有可查询的任务</view><view wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select"><view class="row"><text class="name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="badge {{item.status}}">{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="meta">任务 {{item.id}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.phase}}" class="detail">{{item.phase}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.error}}" class="detail">{{item.error}}</view><view class="footer">{{item.status==='done'?'查看结果 ↗':'查看状态 ›'}}</view></view></scroll-view><button class="works" bindtap="goWorks">完成作品可在“作品”栏查看 ›</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{selected}}" class="modal"><view class="sheet"><view class="heading"><view>{{selected.name}}</view><button class="close" bindtap="closeDetail">×</button></view><view class="meta">任务 {{selected.id}}</view><view class="detail">{{selected.label}}{{reconnecting?' · 正在重新连接':''}}</view><view wx:if="{{selected.phase}}" class="detail">{{selected.phase}}</view><view wx:if="{{selected.error}}" class="detail">{{selected.error}}</view><view class="note">{{selected.billing}}</view><view wx:if="{{selected.status==='done'}}"><view wx:if="{{selected.result.text}}" class="copy">{{selected.result.text}}</view><button class="works" bindtap="openResult">查看此任务完整结果 ›</button></view><view class="note">原消息可能超出最近 30 条；任务详情仍可查询。历史消息定位尚未接入。</view></view></view>
